	(text "IMU (Rev A) - design notes\n\nTDK ICM-42688-P (DS-000347 Rev 1.2) on I2C1 with the BQ25620 (pull-ups on the charger sheet), address 0x68.\nVDD = VDDIO = 3V3 (1.71-3.6 V); bypass per the datasheet BOM: 0.1 uF + 2.2 uF X7R on VDD, 10 nF X7R on VDDIO.\nRESV pins 2, 3, 7, 10, 11 to GND (allowed by Table 9). INT1 data-ready; pin 9 is INT2 (PIN9_FUNCTION reset default).\nSPI fallback: fit R903/R904 and move the node to SPIM1 (P1.02 SCK, P1.03 MOSI, P1.08 MISO, P0.31 CSN);\nthe charger then needs another bus. Status: conditional on real-part verification. Nothing measured."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 50.8 152.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "50a2830e-58e6-40ed-89df-e7716ab63175")
	)
